fgt
------------------------------------------
C++ library for fast Gauss transforms

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libfgt-devel-0.4.11-1bl2
  libfgt0-0.4.11-1bl2
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  eigen3-3.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/gadomski/fgt

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/gadomski/fgt/archive/refs/tags/v0.4.11.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack fgt-0.4.11-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./fgt-0.4.11-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/fgt-0.4.11-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/fgt-0.4.11-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfgt0-0.4.11-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfgt-devel-0.4.11-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(fgt)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/fgt.README
  /usr/share/doc/fgt/LICENSE.txt
  /usr/share/doc/fgt/README.md

(libfgt0)
  /usr/bin/cygfgt-0.dll

(libfgt-devel)
  /usr/include/fgt.hpp
  /usr/lib/cmake/fgt/fgt-config-version.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/fgt/fgt-config.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/fgt/fgt-targets-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/fgt/fgt-targets.cmake
  /usr/lib/libfgt.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/fgt.pc

